I build websites for commercial landscaping companies around {City}. {Business Name} posts good property work, but there's nothing a property manager can bring to an HOA board or a building owner when they bid out the grounds.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: a grounds bid request with acreage and contract start date, a month-by-month maintenance calendar, zone maps, and a board-ready bid package page, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

